      "literal_statement": "Let $G$ be a planar graph, let $\\tau_2(G)$ denote its 2-tone chromatic number, and let $\\Delta(G)$ denote its maximum degree. **Planar 2-tone bound conjecture.** There exists a constant $C$ such that all planar $G$ satisfy\n\n$$\n\\tau_2(G)\\le \\sqrt{3\\Delta(G)}+C.\n$$\n\nThis conjecture predicts the correct order of growth for the 2-tone chromatic number of planar graphs, with the additive constant independent of $G$.",
